WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.093
To see an order's vendor P Os, open the order on Orders, and click Place order.

00:00:15.017 --> 00:00:19.998
Each PO shows its number, the vendor, and the quantity, locked so it cannot change.

00:00:20.449 --> 00:00:24.843
These P Os came from an uploaded list, so they have no PDF here.

00:00:24.843 --> 00:00:31.160
APO made with Generate PO gets View, Download and Print buttons, and an email draft to copy.

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:34.040
Once the vendor has it, tick Order placed.
